379 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Definition: A programmatic advertising platform that allows publishers to coordinate the supply, monetization, and distribution of their advertising inventory to and from advertisers. Supply-side platforms connect advertising networks and exchanges to demand-side platforms \(DSP\) on the advertiser side.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
