<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Term: Programmatic Advertising)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
381 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Definition: An operationalized method of buying and selling ad inventory through the use of Supply Side Platforms \(SSPs\) and Demand Side Platforms \(DSPs\) allowing for real-time bidding on the inventory. The pre-negotiated nature of programmatic advertising creates operational efficiencies in ad serving, ad targeting, sales, billing, and more.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
